# Vendored third-party files are stored byte for byte: git must never rewrite their line
# endings, or a pinned hash (see tests/web/test_static.py) or a license text could differ
# between checkouts. Today htmx.min.js has no line breaks at all, so this really protects
# the license file and any vendored file added later.
src/nbaproj/web/static/* -text
